  "translation": "Last weekend, my family and I went to the park. There were many flowers and trees in the park. We first went to the lake. There was a swan on the lake. We rested under a tree, and Mom took out fruit from her bag. We ate the fruit together. Later, Dad took me to row a boat. I can row a boat. We rowed for two hours. Then, we went to a small shop in front, bought a piece of cake. Behind the small shop there is a garden, on the left is a playground, on the right is a flower bed. We didn't know what that flower was. There were many children there, and we played very happily. In the evening, we went home."
